  "description": "## Feedback panel\nReusable, nonmodal feedback for `loading`, `error`, and `empty` states. Uses verified Bellini box layouts, text nodes, Badge icons, Progress, and Button. Slate surfaces and teal details keep the panel calm; errors use a restrained red outline badge.\n\n### Public interface\n`kind` is a string (`loading`, `error`, or `empty`); unrecognized values use empty guidance. `title` and `message` are plain, escaped text with state-specific fallbacks. `retryLabel` defaults to Retry. Supply `onRetry` only when retry is available; it is invoked without arguments and only from the error state. The parent owns retry/loading transitions.\n\n### Accessibility\nA polite, atomic status region announces feedback without moving focus. Decorative icons and progress are hidden from assistive technology. The animated core progress is removed from display under prefers-reduced-motion and replaced with a static core icon badge using Tailwind motion variants. No assets, API calls, timers, or modal behavior.",
  "modules": [],
  "name": "pw-feedback",
  "styles": [],
  "type": "custom-component",
  "variables": [
    {
      "body": "return $ctrl.title || ($ctrl.kind === 'loading' ? 'Loading' : $ctrl.kind === 'error' ? 'Something went wrong' : 'Nothing here yet');",
      "description": "Provides meaningful heading text even when the parent supplies none.",
      "invokeOnLoad": false,
      "isAsync": false,
      "name": "getTitle",
      "parameters": [],
      "returnType": {
        "name": "any"
      },
      "type": "method",
      "watch": []
    },
    {
      "body": "return $ctrl.message || ($ctrl.kind === 'loading' ? 'Please wait while we get things ready.' : $ctrl.kind === 'error' ? 'We could not complete that request. Please try again when you are ready.' : 'There is nothing to show right now. Try adjusting your filters or check back later.');",
      "description": "Provides concise loading feedback, error explanation, or empty-state guidance.",
      "invokeOnLoad": false,
      "isAsync": false,
      "name": "getMessage",
      "parameters": [],
      "returnType": {
        "name": "any"
      },
      "type": "method",
      "watch": []
    },
    {
      "body": "return $ctrl.kind === 'error' && typeof $ctrl.onRetry === 'function';",
      "description": "Only exposes retry when the state is error and an optional handler exists.",
      "invokeOnLoad": false,
      "isAsync": false,
      "name": "canRetry",
      "parameters": [],
      "returnType": {
        "name": "any"
      },
      "type": "method",
      "watch": []
    },
    {
      "body": "if ($ctrl.canRetry()) {\n  return $ctrl.onRetry();\n}",
      "description": "Guards the optional callback; the parent controls any subsequent loading state.",
      "invokeOnLoad": false,
      "isAsync": false,
      "name": "retry",
      "parameters": [],
      "returnType": {
        "name": "any"
      },
      "type": "method",
      "watch": []
    }
  ]
